                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Tekton plate example (below the beams example)

A CLT box: four walls (t_wall) on centre-line dimensions plus a slab (t_slab) whose mid-plane
meets the wall tops, joined at the four vertical corners. Supports: every node at level 0.
Uses the Backend of the beams pipeline above. RFEM 6 must be running; API key from the repo .env.</item>
