                  <items count="15">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Results per physical beam, straight off the StructuralModel: one envelope value per beam, the samples along each beam as a tree (t on the beam axis, not on the member), the full record as JSON - and a staleness check against the connected model. Wire the TimberModel into 'model' to get the Beam objects in the same order.</item>
